    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 29,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Another insertion!\"",
        "line": 44
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 31,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"WE'RE HERE FOR THE SPIRE!\"",
        "line": 47
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 33,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Liar! Everyone wants the spire! For conquest! For fire!\"",
        "line": 50
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 36,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"NOW, LUMINAIRE!\"",
        "line": 55
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 42,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You... you're with the Spire? Not just another scavenger?\"",
        "line": 64
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 43,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We're here for Aetheric Coil.\"",
        "line": 66
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 56,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Commander,\"",
        "line": 84
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 83,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Anchor. Luminaire. HELP.\"",
        "line": 121
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 85,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The planet's core temperature is rising. The magma arteries are blocked. I regulate the thermal flow, but the blockage\u2014I can't reach it. If I leave this chamber, even for a moment, the planetary systems I'm manually stabilizing collapse immediately. I am trapped. The war outside damages the crust faster than I can compensate. I am... failing.\"",
        "line": 125
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 90,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Something is consuming the excess thermal flow,\"",
        "line": 134
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 125,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You're... the Anchor?\"",
        "line": 180
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 130,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I've been using shadow-paths to evacuate wounded from the front lines. Walking the spire's energy currents without knowing what they were.\"",
        "line": 188
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 132,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You navigate collapsed spaces,\"",
        "line": 191
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 137,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then we need you.\"",
        "line": 198
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 140,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I'm already standing on the planet's arteries,\"",
        "line": 203
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 160,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cThe planet\u2019s thermal regulation is blocked,\u201d",
        "line": 234
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 176,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cWhat comes through those rifts,\u201d",
        "line": 253
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 183,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cWe\u2019ll deal with what comes through later,\u201d",
        "line": 263
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 191,
      "actor": "Nyxthoria",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cUse it well, Anchor,\u201d",
        "line": 274
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 204,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cWe do,\u201d",
        "line": 293
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 205,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cYou understand what it is?\u201d",
        "line": 295
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 215,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cThree hundred years. Perhaps four.\u201d",
        "line": 308
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 216,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cAnd if the planet\u2019s core regulation fails? How much time does everything lose?\u201d",
        "line": 310
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 221,
      "actor": "Zerathune",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cA shorter life on a living world,\u201d",
        "line": 318
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 231,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cDo not let my sacrifice be for cinders,\u201d",
        "line": 332
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 238,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cAelxion vouches for you. And you smell of my son\u2019s cause.\u201d",
        "line": 344
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 240,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cWe need it to reignite the core\u2019s flow after we clear the blockage,\u201d",
        "line": 347
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 249,
      "actor": "Oreck",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cWe\u2019re asking you,\u201d",
        "line": 359
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 253,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cYou are not my son,\u201d",
        "line": 365
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 259,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cTake it. Restart the heart. I will fight my war with tooth and claw and rage. It will have to be enough.\u201d",
        "line": 373
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 277,
      "actor": "Oreck",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cThen we dig,\u201d",
        "line": 398
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 278,
      "actor": "Luminaire",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cI cannot follow you,\u201d",
        "line": 400
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 304,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Left here,\"",
        "line": 439
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 319,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Something down here is\u2026 wrong,\"",
        "line": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 379,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The heart!\"",
        "line": 544
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 403,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"RUN!\"",
        "line": 581
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 424,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The planet will survive,\"",
        "line": 611
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 432,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The worm's death bought us time,\"",
        "line": 622
      }
    }
  ],
